MATRIX: A perceptron learning the AND gate. A positive score is SIGMA.

ESCAPE THE MATRIX

HUSTLE step WITH score
  IF score IS GREATER THAN 0 THEN
    CASH OUT 1
  PERIOD
  CASH OUT 0
DONE HUSTLING

HUSTLE score WITH x AND y AND w0 AND w1 AND bias
  CASH OUT w0 TIMES x PLUS w1 TIMES y PLUS bias
DONE HUSTLING

HUSTLE train WITH rate AND epochs
  BUGATTI w0 EQUALS 0
  BUGATTI w1 EQUALS 0
  BUGATTI bias EQUALS 0
  BUGATTI inputs EQUALS [[0, 0], [0, 1], [1, 0], [1, 1]]
  BUGATTI labels EQUALS [0, 0, 0, 1]
  BUGATTI epoch EQUALS 0
  GRIND WHILE epoch IS LESS THAN epochs
    BUGATTI i EQUALS 0
    GRIND WHILE i IS LESS THAN 4
      BUGATTI row EQUALS CALL at (inputs, i)
      BUGATTI x EQUALS CALL at (row, 0)
      BUGATTI y EQUALS CALL at (row, 1)
      BUGATTI guess EQUALS CALL step WITH CALL score (x, y, w0, w1, bias)
      BUGATTI miss EQUALS CALL at (labels, i) MINUS guess
      BUGATTI w0 EQUALS w0 PLUS rate TIMES miss TIMES x
      BUGATTI w1 EQUALS w1 PLUS rate TIMES miss TIMES y
      BUGATTI bias EQUALS bias PLUS rate TIMES miss
      BUGATTI i EQUALS i PLUS 1
    STOP GRINDING
    BUGATTI epoch EQUALS epoch PLUS 1
  STOP GRINDING
  CASH OUT [w0, w1, bias]
DONE HUSTLING

BUGATTI model EQUALS CALL train (1, 12)
WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI model
WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI CALL step WITH CALL score (0, 0, CALL at (model, 0), CALL at (model, 1), CALL at (model, 2))
WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI CALL step WITH CALL score (0, 1, CALL at (model, 0), CALL at (model, 1), CALL at (model, 2))
WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI CALL step WITH CALL score (1, 0, CALL at (model, 0), CALL at (model, 1), CALL at (model, 2))
WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI CALL step WITH CALL score (1, 1, CALL at (model, 0), CALL at (model, 1), CALL at (model, 2))

BACK TO THE MATRIX
